
# My Favorite Movie

## Spider-Man: Across the Spider-Verse

**Spider-Man: Across the Spider-Verse** is an animated superhero movie released in 2023. It follows Miles Morales as he travels across different universes and meets other Spider-People.

### Why I Like This Movie

I like this movie because of its **amazing animation**, *interesting story*, and unique versions of Spider-Man.

### My Favorite Characters

- **Miles Morales** – The main character who protects his universe.
- **Gwen Stacy** – A skilled Spider-Woman from another universe.
- **Peter B. Parker** – An experienced Spider-Man who helps Miles.

### My Favorite Scene

> Miles Morales shows that being a hero means making your own choices, even when others disagree with you.

